WEBVTT

00:00:00.630 --> 00:00:01.550
Morning.

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:06.420
Nihao!

00:00:06.420 --> 00:00:07.770
I'm Oribe Yasu—

00:01:50.470 --> 00:01:52.160
Yasuna's house.

00:01:52.700 --> 00:01:55.950
And now, the moment of the century!

00:02:00.400 --> 00:02:03.240
Wow! He bent it!

00:02:03.240 --> 00:02:05.260
Wow!

00:02:05.560 --> 00:02:06.650
The next day.

00:02:09.560 --> 00:02:11.560
So I decided to bring some!

00:02:13.370 --> 00:02:19.240
I think I might have esper powers too!

00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:19.240
You're way too easily influenced.

00:02:20.220 --> 00:02:25.240
Maybe you also have hidden esper powers!

00:02:25.240 --> 00:02:26.770
Not a chance.

00:02:27.090 --> 00:02:28.800
They said so on TV!

00:02:28.800 --> 00:02:31.520
Anyone can develop esper
powers if they practice enough!

00:02:31.970 --> 00:02:35.090
Don't you want to become an esper girl?!

00:02:35.090 --> 00:02:37.460
You just want someone to play along with you.

00:02:37.790 --> 00:02:40.420
Espers are super cool!

00:02:40.420 --> 00:02:43.290
It would come in handy for your work too!

00:02:43.290 --> 00:02:45.360
Only if I could actually do it.

00:02:45.800 --> 00:02:49.850
Well, something like eye beams
would be pretty useful I guess.

00:02:50.850 --> 00:02:54.390
I'm talking about esper powers, you know.

00:02:59.520 --> 00:03:02.470
I'll start off with spoon bending!

00:03:02.470 --> 00:03:04.390
Have fun with that.

00:03:04.870 --> 00:03:06.810
Psychic powers, awaken!

00:03:08.350 --> 00:03:09.700
Eyesight power up!

00:03:09.700 --> 00:03:11.590
I'm an esper!

00:03:11.590 --> 00:03:13.570
Don't act dumb to cover it up.

00:03:14.190 --> 00:03:16.570
Then I'll use two and...

00:03:16.570 --> 00:03:19.320
Transform!

00:03:24.110 --> 00:03:27.260
Spoon bending isn't the only esper power I have!

00:03:27.260 --> 00:03:30.340
Next I'll perform magic with these playing cards.

00:03:30.340 --> 00:03:32.070
You just said "magic"!

00:03:34.700 --> 00:03:36.570
I'll demonstrate powers of clairvoyance!

00:03:36.570 --> 00:03:38.970
Pick a card and I'll say what it is.

00:03:38.970 --> 00:03:40.340
She totally ignored me.

00:03:40.700 --> 00:03:42.160
Whatever, hurry up and pick one.

00:03:45.580 --> 00:03:46.410
I can see it!

00:03:46.680 --> 00:03:49.770
The card you picked is the ace of spades!

00:03:52.900 --> 00:03:54.730
Joker.

00:03:55.770 --> 00:03:57.860
If this was Old Maid I would have won.

00:04:01.250 --> 00:04:05.320
Next: Esper Pyramid Power!

00:04:05.320 --> 00:04:06.540
You're still at it?

00:04:07.950 --> 00:04:09.590
If I can do this...

00:04:10.050 --> 00:04:12.940
it would totally be esper powers!

00:04:13.190 --> 00:04:15.090
Just a moment...

00:04:18.230 --> 00:04:21.300
Just a little further and I'll be an esper...

00:04:24.900 --> 00:04:27.760
That isn't esper powers!

00:04:29.890 --> 00:04:33.650
Did you have to do that right before I finished?!

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:39.690
If that's all it takes, then
I'll show you my esper powers too.

00:04:39.690 --> 00:04:40.840
Hold this.

00:04:48.840 --> 00:04:50.000
Well?

00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:51.080
Eh?

00:04:51.430 --> 00:04:53.250
That wasn't esper powers at all.

00:04:55.460 --> 00:04:59.300
Then I'll show you spontaneous combustion next.

00:04:59.300 --> 00:05:01.480
S-Scary face...

00:05:02.050 --> 00:05:05.010
Are you going to use a
lighter or something for that?

00:05:05.410 --> 00:05:06.910
Not at all.

00:05:06.910 --> 00:05:08.700
I'll do it with just one finger.

00:05:09.700 --> 00:05:11.550
That's nothing then!

00:05:11.550 --> 00:05:14.720
Go ahead and show me!

00:05:19.690 --> 00:05:21.150
Ow!

00:05:21.550 --> 00:05:24.990
Please don't burn your friends.

00:05:26.580 --> 00:05:30.590
My true esper power is seeing the future!

00:05:30.590 --> 00:05:33.540
You're just saying whatever
comes to mind, aren't you?

00:05:33.540 --> 00:05:35.340
I can see it!

00:05:35.340 --> 00:05:38.420
In the future I'm going to be rich!

00:05:39.280 --> 00:05:40.430
<i>So lame!</i>

00:05:41.330 --> 00:05:44.390
Sonya-chan, you're going to go bankrupt.

00:05:46.660 --> 00:05:49.340
I foretell that I'm going to get hit in the near future!

00:05:49.340 --> 00:05:51.260
That definitely sounds like it'll come true.

00:05:51.260 --> 00:05:53.240
Huuuh?

00:05:53.240 --> 00:05:55.620
What are you two doing?

00:05:55.620 --> 00:05:56.580
Agiri-san?

00:06:01.040 --> 00:06:03.120
Esper powers?

00:06:03.120 --> 00:06:08.100
Yes! Do you want to try
bending spoons or something too?

00:06:09.350 --> 00:06:15.320
I can't bend spoons, but I do have a
ninja technique for bending forks.

00:06:15.780 --> 00:06:17.250
Specifically forks?

00:06:17.550 --> 00:06:19.270
A ninja technique, too!

00:06:19.270 --> 00:06:23.050
Allow me to show you then.

00:06:23.500 --> 00:06:27.100
Fork...

00:06:27.760 --> 00:06:31.240
Bend!

00:06:33.510 --> 00:06:35.660
E-Esper?!

00:06:36.020 --> 00:06:40.800
No, this is just a ninja technique.

00:06:47.110 --> 00:06:48.600
Another day.

00:06:51.450 --> 00:06:54.900
I got a lucky charm with the
fortune-telling magazine I bought!

00:06:54.900 --> 00:06:57.400
You got tired of espers and moved to fortune-telling?

00:06:57.400 --> 00:06:59.310
You sure like that stuff...

00:06:59.310 --> 00:07:01.480
So what did you get?

00:07:02.740 --> 00:07:03.490
This!

00:07:04.050 --> 00:07:06.380
Isn't that a voodoo doll?

00:07:06.380 --> 00:07:09.680
Yes! A real cursed voodoo doll!

00:07:10.050 --> 00:07:12.650
How is that a lucky charm?

00:07:12.650 --> 00:07:17.310
The magazine says you'll become
happy if all your problems disappear.

00:07:17.720 --> 00:07:18.690
That's morbid!

00:07:19.660 --> 00:07:22.440
I'm sure that's a joke, but this is the real thing.

00:07:22.990 --> 00:07:25.570
I put a strand of my hair in it.

00:07:26.050 --> 00:07:28.120
It'll work, really!

00:07:28.120 --> 00:07:30.940
Move it around and see!

00:07:35.330 --> 00:07:37.290
I bent it forward.

00:07:37.950 --> 00:07:40.820
Well, there's bound to be minor errors.

00:07:40.820 --> 00:07:41.780
Errors?

00:07:46.750 --> 00:07:51.740
I guess that means one strand of
hair only works for 3 minutes.

00:07:54.160 --> 00:07:59.230
I put some of your hair into this
other voodoo doll that I brought!

00:07:59.230 --> 00:08:00.710
When?!

00:08:00.710 --> 00:08:01.440
Go!

00:08:08.650 --> 00:08:12.510
Fine. I'll try something simpler to start.

00:08:12.510 --> 00:08:14.660
I'm not going to do it.

00:08:18.580 --> 00:08:19.460
Other way.

00:08:23.360 --> 00:08:29.500
You don't need something as
unscientific as a curse to get rid of someone.

00:08:29.500 --> 00:08:31.960
It really works!

00:08:31.960 --> 00:08:33.740
Don't you believe?

00:08:33.740 --> 00:08:34.390
No.

00:08:34.780 --> 00:08:39.020
Then you're fine with your own doll getting beat up?

00:08:46.010 --> 00:08:48.800
Forget the curse, you're pissing me off.

00:08:48.800 --> 00:08:51.340
So mean!

00:08:51.340 --> 00:08:54.610
What if the curse really worked?!

00:08:54.610 --> 00:08:55.490
It won't.

00:08:56.050 --> 00:08:56.990
Huh?

00:08:57.550 --> 00:08:59.480
This is your one.

00:09:00.770 --> 00:09:06.240
Oh? Weren't you a total unbeliever?

00:09:06.240 --> 00:09:08.040
Well, mostly...

00:09:10.970 --> 00:09:13.390
This means calamity will befall your hips.

00:09:14.870 --> 00:09:17.010
If something really does happen, I'll believe you.

00:09:17.500 --> 00:09:20.350
Calamity kick!

00:09:23.650 --> 00:09:26.370
Looks like someone cursed your foot.

00:09:26.950 --> 00:09:29.320
I wasn't actually going to kick you!

00:09:29.320 --> 00:09:31.150
It wasn't a curse!

00:09:31.910 --> 00:09:34.620
So let's give that a break and do fortune-telling.

00:09:35.590 --> 00:09:37.150
Fortune-telling?

00:09:37.150 --> 00:09:38.540
Sounds good to me.

00:09:40.250 --> 00:09:44.210
I heard they used to use
broken bones to tell one's fortune.

00:09:44.210 --> 00:09:47.340
Sonya-chan, you're making a scary face again.

00:09:47.400 --> 00:09:53.240
<i>They didn't use the bones of the living,
but instead burned animal bones.</i>

00:09:54.640 --> 00:09:58.910
That aside, how about you draw
one of these to see your fortune.

00:09:58.910 --> 00:10:00.690
Go on, take one.

00:10:02.890 --> 00:10:07.090
Your fortune says that you aren't too lucky at drawing.

00:10:07.090 --> 00:10:08.270
What the heck?

00:10:09.910 --> 00:10:13.480
I'm getting a bad feeling from your legs.

00:10:13.480 --> 00:10:16.360
You may lose your shoes later on.

00:10:16.980 --> 00:10:18.850
Seriously?

00:10:20.070 --> 00:10:21.680
I'm going to the bathroom.

00:10:29.640 --> 00:10:33.420
Did you really think I'd fall for that?

00:10:35.720 --> 00:10:37.810
Let's do palm reading.

00:10:37.810 --> 00:10:39.810
I read a book about it.

00:10:40.660 --> 00:10:41.430
Let me see.

00:10:44.170 --> 00:10:46.800
Have you been having stomach problems lately?

00:10:46.800 --> 00:10:48.200
You have, right?

00:10:48.200 --> 00:10:48.950
Ow!

00:10:48.950 --> 00:10:52.320
You read a book on pressure points,
not palm reading, didn't you?!

00:10:52.320 --> 00:10:55.460
No! This <i>is</i> palm reading!

00:10:55.460 --> 00:10:58.020
Sheesh. Trying to use these tricks on me...

00:11:02.950 --> 00:11:04.840
Oh, it's Yasuna's voodoo doll.

00:11:05.580 --> 00:11:07.900
Clean up after yourself. Seriously.

00:11:14.390 --> 00:11:17.930
It... It actually worked?

00:11:19.900 --> 00:11:23.640
<i>When I realize I have spent
my days in front of the inkstone...</i>

00:11:23.640 --> 00:11:30.980
<i>with nothing better to do but write down
what random nonsense enters my mind...</i>

00:11:38.550 --> 00:11:40.500
It sure is raining hard.

00:11:40.500 --> 00:11:41.630
Yeah.

00:11:41.630 --> 00:11:44.900
If it keeps raining, it'll be bad.

00:11:44.900 --> 00:11:46.620
How so?

00:11:46.620 --> 00:11:48.670
Bread will get moldy,

00:11:48.670 --> 00:11:51.440
rice cakes will get moldy...

00:11:51.440 --> 00:11:52.380
Nothing else, really.

00:11:52.380 --> 00:11:56.260
Your mind sure is simple.

00:12:06.560 --> 00:12:09.460
Since it's raining, let's think of things to do!

00:12:09.460 --> 00:12:11.700
Since it's raining, we should study.

00:12:14.070 --> 00:12:16.900
You just don't get it, Sonya-chan!

00:12:16.900 --> 00:12:20.270
Only an idiot studies all the time!

00:12:20.270 --> 00:12:22.100
What do you want to do, then?

00:12:23.090 --> 00:12:24.420
Ta-da!

00:12:24.880 --> 00:12:27.140
Puzzle rings!

00:12:27.730 --> 00:12:29.800
This'll stimulate your brain!

00:12:29.800 --> 00:12:32.180
We can have fun while using our minds!

00:12:32.180 --> 00:12:34.170
Mind power!

00:12:34.170 --> 00:12:36.550
I don't think that actually works.

00:12:36.550 --> 00:12:38.310
Don't say that!

00:12:38.310 --> 00:12:40.160
Don't think you can separate these?

00:12:40.160 --> 00:12:41.920
If you want to prove me wrong, then sep—

00:12:43.080 --> 00:12:44.500
You're going to separate it...

00:12:44.500 --> 00:12:45.950
You're going to separate it!

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:51.610
Please use your mind to separate them.

00:12:52.010 --> 00:12:53.020
Sheesh.

00:12:56.660 --> 00:12:58.860
This is actually pretty hard.

00:13:02.380 --> 00:13:04.220
What was that?!

00:13:04.220 --> 00:13:05.690
Can <i>you</i> do it?!

00:13:05.690 --> 00:13:06.510
Stop!

00:13:06.510 --> 00:13:07.380
Use your mind!

00:13:07.750 --> 00:13:08.850
Screw it!

00:13:08.850 --> 00:13:10.500
This isn't worth my time!

00:13:12.740 --> 00:13:15.080
Oh, you separated it.

00:13:15.080 --> 00:13:16.070
What?

00:13:17.930 --> 00:13:20.560
Told you I was smart.

00:13:20.560 --> 00:13:22.530
That wasn't using your mind at all!

00:13:25.310 --> 00:13:28.290
If it bothers you, try using your own head to do it.

00:13:28.290 --> 00:13:30.260
Damn it.

00:13:30.260 --> 00:13:32.740
While you're saying that...!

00:13:34.210 --> 00:13:35.130
What are you doing?

00:13:35.130 --> 00:13:38.750
Yay! I used my head and separated it!

00:13:38.750 --> 00:13:39.720
Hey.

00:13:51.510 --> 00:13:54.220
The rain's going to continue all afternoon.

00:13:54.220 --> 00:13:55.420
How do you know?

00:13:55.900 --> 00:14:00.140
If you can't read the weather,
then you can't do a pro's work.

00:14:01.840 --> 00:14:05.210
A "pro"? You're more like a weather lady.

00:14:06.420 --> 00:14:07.550
I know!

00:14:07.550 --> 00:14:10.860
Let's make some Teru Teru Bouzu to stop the rain!

00:14:12.400 --> 00:14:15.110
Acting like a child again...

00:14:20.240 --> 00:14:23.410
Yay! Perfect!

00:14:23.790 --> 00:14:25.880
All right, I'll make one too.

00:14:26.670 --> 00:14:29.130
A life-sized Teru Teru Bouzu.

00:14:29.550 --> 00:14:30.700
I'm sorry!

00:14:32.160 --> 00:14:35.700
I just thought of something we can do while it rains!

00:14:35.700 --> 00:14:37.460
It's probably something stupid.

00:14:37.460 --> 00:14:39.620
It's called the Imaginary Sun!

00:14:40.050 --> 00:14:44.390
You just need to pretend real hard that
a real sun is shining down hard around here.

00:14:46.880 --> 00:14:50.670
Ahh, I can feel the rain just going away.

00:14:52.810 --> 00:14:55.310
There's no rain, no humidity.

00:14:56.410 --> 00:14:59.670
Yes. This is just a dry desert.

00:15:01.600 --> 00:15:06.150
A... desert...

00:15:08.290 --> 00:15:11.330
Sonya-chan... water!

00:15:11.330 --> 00:15:12.470
There's a bunch outside.

00:15:18.340 --> 00:15:21.050
Since we have to deal with the rain now,

00:15:21.050 --> 00:15:23.180
we might as well approach it in a proactive way.

00:15:23.780 --> 00:15:24.850
How so?

00:15:25.360 --> 00:15:29.340
Look! Look! This is so fun!

00:15:29.340 --> 00:15:31.020
Sonya-chan, c'mon!

00:15:31.020 --> 00:15:31.980
No thanks.

00:15:33.290 --> 00:15:34.800
It's so much fun!

00:15:36.490 --> 00:15:38.740
So much fun!

00:15:40.050 --> 00:15:43.730
Damn! This is seriously so much fun!

00:15:50.170 --> 00:15:51.640
Dang.

00:16:02.010 --> 00:16:03.970
Another morning.

00:16:11.310 --> 00:16:12.740
So it's here.

00:16:12.740 --> 00:16:15.650
The school that Oribe and Sonya go to.

00:16:16.050 --> 00:16:17.590
Just you wait.

00:16:17.590 --> 00:16:22.740
Soon, you'll taste the terror of
having your spotlight stolen.

00:16:27.660 --> 00:16:31.150
Hey. You're late.

00:16:31.150 --> 00:16:32.560
No, I...

00:16:32.560 --> 00:16:37.760
Teacher's are always saying how
bad it is to be late, aren't they?

00:16:37.760 --> 00:16:40.500
What year are you? What class?

00:16:40.500 --> 00:16:41.930
What's your name?

00:16:41.930 --> 00:16:45.210
I, uh, don't have a name...

00:16:45.740 --> 00:16:47.100
I'm sorry.

00:16:49.510 --> 00:16:51.870
There've been a lot of crows recently.

00:16:52.410 --> 00:16:56.300
Maybe they're reacting to
your thirst for blood, Sonya-chan.

00:16:56.300 --> 00:16:58.010
No way.

00:16:58.010 --> 00:17:00.570
They do follow me around sometimes, though.

00:17:00.570 --> 00:17:01.860
I knew it!

00:17:02.750 --> 00:17:06.660
Here's a present to protect
you from birds, Sonya-chan!

00:17:08.060 --> 00:17:11.390
If you wear this, then the birds
won't follow you around anymore.

00:17:11.390 --> 00:17:13.800
I'll help you put it on.

00:17:20.630 --> 00:17:23.780
You were just thinking that this
would keep people away too, right?

00:17:23.780 --> 00:17:25.650
You're scaring me, Sonya-chan!

00:17:28.060 --> 00:17:31.600
Where are you, Yasuna, Sonya?

00:17:31.910 --> 00:17:37.440
I'm going to give the violent Sonya-chan
my best friend ever, Pyonsuke,

00:17:37.440 --> 00:17:40.360
so that maybe she'll try to be kinder.

00:17:40.860 --> 00:17:44.500
Even though she's evil and has the face of a demon,

00:17:44.500 --> 00:17:48.700
she may be healed in a flash after holding onto Pyonsuke.

00:17:49.450 --> 00:17:51.290
I heard that, you know.

00:17:52.060 --> 00:17:54.670
I have no interest in stuffed animals.

00:17:54.670 --> 00:17:56.010
Again with that?

00:17:56.010 --> 00:17:57.610
Don't say that!

00:18:00.080 --> 00:18:01.760
You hold him tight like that,

00:18:01.760 --> 00:18:04.260
and have a nice conversation with him.

00:18:05.340 --> 00:18:07.970
Hey! I'm Pyonsuke!

00:18:07.970 --> 00:18:09.800
What's your name?

00:18:11.260 --> 00:18:12.770
I hate his voice.

00:18:19.710 --> 00:18:21.120
You're so mean!

00:18:21.120 --> 00:18:23.050
My poor Pyonsuke!

00:18:23.050 --> 00:18:25.310
You gave him such a weird voice.

00:18:26.550 --> 00:18:28.520
I'll avenge you, Pyonkichi!

00:18:28.520 --> 00:18:30.030
Wasn't his name Pyonsuke?

00:18:30.660 --> 00:18:31.660
Whatever.

00:18:31.940 --> 00:18:34.810
If you want to fight, I'll take you on any day.

00:18:37.660 --> 00:18:39.040
Time out for a second.

00:18:39.770 --> 00:18:41.680
I'll decide the event.

00:18:41.680 --> 00:18:42.800
Event?

00:18:44.160 --> 00:18:45.550
I've finally found you!

00:18:45.550 --> 00:18:47.000
Yasuna, Sonya!

00:18:47.000 --> 00:18:50.220
Today is your last...

00:18:53.160 --> 00:18:55.910
With that said, our event will be sumo.

00:18:55.910 --> 00:18:58.520
Not that I mind... but why?

00:19:00.620 --> 00:19:06.010
<i>I've never actually done it, but you can't
punch or kick in sumo, so it can't hurt all that much.</i>

00:19:06.010 --> 00:19:09.780
<i>At any rate, I'll win! I'm Japanese, after all!</i>

00:19:10.370 --> 00:19:12.370
No basis.

00:19:12.370 --> 00:19:15.570
All right! Let us begin!

00:19:16.410 --> 00:19:17.580
<i>That's so lame...!</i>

00:19:17.580 --> 00:19:21.670
Get set... Go!

00:19:27.630 --> 00:19:30.530
You can't use submissions in sumo...

00:19:31.210 --> 00:19:32.540
You can't?

00:19:33.030 --> 00:19:35.380
Do you even know what sumo is?

00:19:35.380 --> 00:19:39.490
You know, that thing a lot of fat people do.

00:19:39.490 --> 00:19:41.200
That's all she knows about it.

00:19:41.720 --> 00:19:43.910
I've seen it a bit before.

00:19:43.910 --> 00:19:46.850
All right! Let's give this another try!

00:19:47.260 --> 00:19:49.570
By the way, you're not allowed to poke my eyes.

00:19:51.270 --> 00:19:52.700
Oh. Is that right?

00:19:52.700 --> 00:19:56.090
I'll show you the true path of sumo!

00:19:56.090 --> 00:19:59.300
Get set... Go!

00:20:02.510 --> 00:20:04.300
You never said I couldn't slap you.

00:20:08.680 --> 00:20:10.470
I've found you this time.

00:20:11.070 --> 00:20:12.930
Yasuna! Sonya!

00:20:13.480 --> 00:20:15.640
I'll turn you into dirt around the sumo arena!

00:20:21.140 --> 00:20:23.720
Damn it.

00:20:24.660 --> 00:20:26.640
Yasuna, Sonya...

00:20:26.640 --> 00:20:28.470
It's unfair to run away like that.

00:20:29.070 --> 00:20:31.900
And so, on TV, I saw...

00:20:38.510 --> 00:20:40.000
Who was that?

00:20:40.000 --> 00:20:41.060
Dunno.

00:20:41.710 --> 00:20:42.660
Oh yeah!

00:20:44.560 --> 00:20:47.870
Here, it's your turn to wear it, Sonya-chan.

00:20:47.870 --> 00:20:50.950
Do you think I'll wear it even if you say that?

00:20:51.310 --> 00:20:53.440
Yeah. You look good in it!

00:21:03.640 --> 00:21:05.310
That was scary!

00:21:05.310 --> 00:21:08.040
Oribe Yasuna, Sonya...

00:21:08.040 --> 00:21:10.350
You two really are strong opponents.

00:21:10.810 --> 00:21:13.080
I won't give up though!

00:21:13.080 --> 00:21:14.950
Just you watch, God!

00:21:14.950 --> 00:21:18.060
I'll show you that I won't
stay an unused character forever!

00:21:19.150 --> 00:21:21.050
Oh, God!

00:21:21.820 --> 00:21:22.820
That's impossible.

00:21:28.510 --> 00:21:30.810
Hey! Look, look! Sonya-chan!

00:21:30.810 --> 00:21:31.970
Oh, Hydrangeaceae.

00:21:32.360 --> 00:21:33.960
They're beautiful.

00:21:34.910 --> 00:21:36.080
Sorry to bother ya.

00:21:36.090 --> 00:21:36.970
I'm just a caterpillar.

00:21:37.390 --> 00:21:38.730
What's wrong?

00:21:38.730 --> 00:21:40.830
St-Stay back!

00:21:43.110 --> 00:21:48.260
I don't really understand, but have you
finally come to see how scary I can be?!

00:21:48.260 --> 00:21:49.910
No!

00:21:49.910 --> 00:21:50.950
It's a ca... A ca...

00:21:50.950 --> 00:21:54.450
A caterpillar!

00:21:56.400 --> 00:21:58.090
Wait there, Sonya-kun!

00:21:58.090 --> 00:22:00.580
Stay back! Just stay back!

00:22:00.580 --> 00:22:03.140
I'll kill you if you come any closer!

00:22:05.890 --> 00:22:09.140
Esper, Curse, Rain, Sumo.

00:23:40.940 --> 00:23:43.140
All or nothing, a huge gamble.

00:23:43.140 --> 00:23:45.410
Persuaded into an orchestra of crickets.

00:23:45.410 --> 00:23:47.460
Bewitching contest by a rod and a cup,

00:23:47.460 --> 00:23:49.500
messy battle and surrounded by assassins.

00:23:59.630 --> 00:24:02.130
Next time, on Kill Me Baby,

00:24:02.130 --> 00:24:03.400
Kill number four:

00:24:03.400 --> 00:24:06.110
Ice Cream, Watermelon, Assassins.

00:24:06.110 --> 00:24:09.040
Now, what will you do, Oribe Yasuna?
